{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mN9kxlVvCX1794220094.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞洲壁球團體錦標賽，港隊女團相隔四年再稱后。</p><p></p><p>港隊分組三戰全勝，決賽對馬來西亞。謝依霖首場先失一局下，反勝3-1先拔頭籌。緊接到陳善鈺，再以3-1鎖定勝局。即使李嘉兒第三場落敗，港隊都以場數2-1稱后，是港隊歷來第六次贏得團體亞洲冠軍。</p><p></p><p>港隊在男子團體賽四強不敵東道主巴基斯坦，取得銅牌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.818006+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T10:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:14.465611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:25.208738+00:00","content_hash":"2d39f9f781bb8cbdcb3ae8921b0fb865b93fdd23bc76516c344437c7804cca32","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:22:36.818006+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}